<title>HUNGARY: CESI index declines, ends at 1,447.01 points.</title>
<headline>CESI index declines, ends at 1,447.01 points.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CESI Central European Share Index fell 20.30 points or 1.38 percent to 1,447.01 points on Thursday, the Budapest Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>The index reflects trends of 72 Hungarian, Polish, Czech, Slovak and Slovenian shares.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
